 counter near the apple sellers. Finally clapping on the wall and beginning the morning rush. The market wasn't just a place to buy things; it was the beating heart of the town before the long day unfolded. *Let me see it.*...the sound of a heavy footstep echoed across", "text_sha256": "cb834f39dc96a0585d6a3c98198179746bb341a90b1f0e5cc6b618dcd1da96b6", "token_ids": [1597, 279, 12174, 2981, 71072, 998, 6941, 310, 2341, 685, 1040, 32746, 3474, 339, 17881, 34200, 279, 51172, 3017, 430, 279, 5647, 1807, 425, 314, 279, 3988, 7106, 3727, 310, 9704, 494, 13459, 854, 13, 561, 3594, 557, 1990, 321, 8545, 440, 279, 39029, 314, 897, 14299, 1027, 1091, 321, 279, 26576, 314, 34954, 54060, 836, 26684, 2272, 279, 26515, 21664, 25115, 13, 328, 9764, 728, 1436, 424, 1288, 264, 5956, 54862, 5054, 42007, 888, 279, 67010, 314, 2748, 45970, 836, 1118, 4965, 883, 72979, 321, 13383, 13, 40967, 264, 21664, 5373, 78870, 440, 78902, 314, 39332, 321, 66031, 314, 18237, 7481, 264, 855, 303, 264, 51544, 6105, 15024, 6483, 5888, 998, 20924, 1769, 38936, 440, 26576, 430, 551, 41423, 1724, 279, 40473, 5983, 61369, 13, 92244, 14217, 264, 41278, 421, 9047, 310, 2153, 303, 264, 9158, 314, 13358, 15728, 494, 1141, 229979, 430, 264, 20100, 68097, 1881, 19484, 6113, 12, 2395, 88562, 310, 8418, 3951, 6267, 19052, 303, 57955, 2400, 440, 56637, 5415, 321, 264, 39502, 18075, 421, 687, 1086, 22525, 13, 1049, 557, 264, 5918, 314, 50240, 35091, 321, 16850, 40720, 421, 5964, 21681, 1083, 264, 7948, 8008, 314, 3809, 421, 488, 1362, 2579, 1442, 1472, 279, 8545, 37260, 53768, 321, 279, 22962, 9502, 1678, 7573, 22962, 539, 279, 24124, 13, 33042, 30489, 506, 264, 10548, 15775, 421, 21748, 1172, 264, 9041, 75294, 26, 2361, 11878, 264, 16002, 314, 44566, 383, 279, 5373, 3043, 279, 22544, 34954, 13, 16864, 1145, 3507, 383, 279, 6784, 321, 6941, 279, 6353, 12601, 13, 561, 2981, 5532, 914, 1066, 264, 1925, 310, 3569, 2433, 26, 424, 557, 279, 25315, 4593, 314, 279, 6092, 1518, 279, 1248, 1834, 73096, 13, 348, 9764, 728, 1